                                "sense_id": "cc31ec1a-11df-3405-9152-a07b738d601b",
                                "text": "The iterative pairing and unpairing cycles may tether plasmids equidistantly on the nucleoid to ensure faithful plasmid segregation by a mechanism compatible with the diffusion-ratchet mechanism as proposed from in vitro reconstituted systems."
